{
  "$comment": [
    "Pinned Catena-X aspect models. Data, not constants \u2014 see docs/adr/0005.",
    "Each model is pinned to an upstream commit, not to a branch. A tag can be moved and",
    "a branch certainly will be; a commit hash is the only reference that means the same",
    "thing tomorrow. scripts/fetch_samm.py fetches, hashes and verifies against manifests.",
    "",
    "The generated artefacts are fetched alongside the Turtle deliberately. They are the",
    "output of the official Java SAMM toolchain, which makes them the reference our own",
    "generator is checked against \u2014 a free, deterministic parity test that needs no JVM.",
    "",
    "The nine models below are the closure, not a guess. scripts/fetch_samm.py --closure",
    "walks every reference reachable from the BatteryPass aspect and reports any model URN",
    "that is not pinned here. Seven of the nine are reached only through the generic",
    "passport, by ten terms in total, and none of them would have been obvious by reading",
    "the BatteryPass Turtle alone."
  ],
